# Holzen Nox design

Before changing UI, marketing pages, or CSS:

1. Read [`DESIGN.md`](../../DESIGN.md) and [`docs/design/nox/patterns/marketing.md`](../../docs/design/nox/patterns/marketing.md) for marketing.
2. Use tokens from `packages/design-tokens/tokens.css` — never duplicate `--nox-*` in `src/index.css`.
3. Links: `text-nox-text-link`, not `text-primary` or cyan utilities.
4. Highlight / wordmark: `text-nox-text-highlight`, not `#DBB366`.
5. Run `npm run check:design-tokens` and `npm run check:nox-hex` after token or color changes.
